  lines:
  - type: 0
    speaker: Joey
    text: Hey Pops, what's the big ol' factory over yonder?
    choices: []
    choiceActionIds: []
    rewardIds: []
  - type: 0
    speaker: Joey
    text: Wasn't here last time.
    choices: []
    choiceActionIds: []
    rewardIds: []
  - type: 0
    speaker: Wise Joe
    text: 'Don''t go near there. '
    choices: []
    choiceActionIds: []
    rewardIds: []
  - type: 0
    speaker: Wise Joe
    text: I don't trust them manufacturers.
    choices: []
    choiceActionIds: []
    rewardIds: []
  - type: 0
    speaker: Wise Joe
    text: 'Them would rather us choke to death than pay a cent back. '
    choices: []
    choiceActionIds: []
    rewardIds: []
  - type: 0
    speaker: Joey
    text: I feel like factories should be outlawed in residential areas.
    choices: []
    choiceActionIds: []
    rewardIds: []
  - type: 0
    speaker: Wise Joe
    text: Them cityfolk always picking off on us!
    choices: []
